  <metadata>
    <name>Orcas Island 100 25-mile loop</name>
    <desc>Track points (with elevations) and the four station waypoints copy the organizer's official GPX download ("2026 Orcas 100", revised 2.23), linked from rainshadowrunning.com/orcas100.html on 2026-08-13. The 100-mile race runs four laps of this Moran State Park loop; the drawn line GPS-measures 24.0 miles against the organizer's nominal 25-mile loop and 100.8-mile total, which govern pass miles.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.rainshadowrunning.com/orcas100.html"><text>Orcas Island 100 official page</text></link>
  </metadata>
